..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : LSS2.BFUSS
.. Autor          : male
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : mh
.. Funktion       : Berichtsfuss des Infosystems fb/LSS2
.. Functionality  :
..*****************************************************************************
..
.set trans -
..
.formula M|bilsum  = M|bils - M|bilh
.formula M|guvsum  = M|guvs - M|guvh
.formula M|ganfsal = M|asollsum - M|ahabensum
.formula M|vkzsal  = M|vkzsollsum - M|vkzhabensum
.formula M|gvkzsal = M|ggvkzs - M|ggvkzh
.formula M|gessum  = M|esollsum - M|ehabensum
..
.formula U|xstufe = M|stufenbis
..*****************************************************************************
!SUM
..*****************************************************************************
.input "fb/LSS2.SUM"
.formula U|xstufe = U|xstufe - 1
.continue SUM ? U|xstufe >= M|stufenvon
.continue END
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
..*****************************************************************************
.continue
